RULE LOADED: 030-api-tests

- Every new or changed route under `backend/src/routes/` needs coverage in
  `backend/tests/unit/`. Assert status code **and** body shape.
- **New** endpoints must use `sendEnvelope` / `sendError` from
  `backend/src/utils/envelope.js` (v2: `{ data, meta }` / `{ error, meta }`).
  Do not call `legacyResponse` from new code. Do not migrate existing v1
  routes unless the ticket explicitly says to.
- Verify with `bash scripts/verify.sh`. Do not skip, retry-loop, or weaken
  assertions to make the suite green.
- Money in request and response bodies is whole rupiah integers.
